---
import Button from '@/components/common/Button.astro';
import { SITE } from '@/utils/constants';
import buoyVideo from '@/assets/videos/buoy.mp4';
---

<section class="relative flex min-h-[calc(100dvh-4rem)] items-center overflow-hidden">
  <video
    class="absolute inset-0 size-full object-cover motion-reduce:hidden"
    src={buoyVideo}
    autoplay
    muted
    loop
    playsinline
    preload="metadata"
    aria-hidden="true"
  ></video>

  <div
    class="absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-r from-surface-primary/25 via-surface-primary/10 to-transparent"
  >
  </div>

  <div class="relative mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-6 py-16">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <p class="mb-4 text-sm font-medium tracking-wide text-content-interactive-primary">
        해양·기상 데이터 전문기업
      </p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl leading-tight font-bold text-content-primary md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">
        해양·기상 데이터를<br />
        <span class="text-content-interactive-primary">연결하는 기술</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-content-tertiary">
        더 정확한 예측과 더 안전한 의사결정을 만듭니다.<br class="hidden md:block" />
        관측장비, 데이터 수집, 수치모델, GIS 시각화, 관제시스템까지 통합 제공합니다.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
        <Button href={`${ SITE.base }/services`} size="lg">서비스 보기</Button>
        <Button href={`${ SITE.base }/contact`} variant="outline" size="lg">문의하기</Button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
